        tenant_v090_policy.php
        tenant_v090_inspector.php
        updater_v090.php
        cardano_v080_*.php
        ... chain-specific private modules
```

Example installation settings for **root mode**:

```php
// Illustrative public URL values only. Edit the EXISTING protected settings
// array; never replace the file with this snippet.
'wallet_origin' => 'https://wallet.example.org',
'wallet_base_path' => '',
```

`wallet_base_path` is the **public URL path**. The root installation uses an empty string. It is NOT `/coxy-wallet-private-isolated`, and the private directory must not be referenced by an HTTP URL.

### 5.2 Layout B: wallet in a website folder (legacy/add-on mode)

```text
hosting-account/
  public_html/
    index.php                         (parent website)
    coxy-wallet/                      <-- public URL /coxy-wallet/
      index.php
      api.php
      wallet-loader.php
      assets/
      sdk/
      ...
  coxy-wallet-private/                <-- outside public_html
    settings.php
    bootstrap.php
    installed.lock
    ...
```

Illustrative public settings:

```php
'wallet_origin' => 'https://example.org',
'wallet_base_path' => '/coxy-wallet',
```

Folder-mode deployments are useful for education and trials but place wallet JavaScript on the same browser origin as the parent website. A compromised parent application can endanger the signing UI. Prefer a dedicated origin for serious use.

### 5.3 Critical hosting checks

- Find the real `DOCUMENT_ROOT` in cPanel/DirectAdmin; never guess from a file-manager breadcrumb.
- The private directory must be outside **every** configured public document root, not merely the wallet's own one.
- The PHP runtime needs read/traverse access to private PHP but anonymous HTTP clients must not.
- Keep backups, diagnostics that are CLI-only, raw SQL migration files, release archives and tests **out of public_html**.
- Do not create another `coxy-wallet/` folder inside the dedicated-root installation.
- Do not change the private-directory naming convention to fix an incorrect `wallet_base_path`.

